{"route":"/docs/5.0/utilities/sizing/","version":"5.0","renderedVersion":"5.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Sizing","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Easily make an element as wide or as tall with our width and height utilities."},"blocks":[{"id":"relative-to-the-parent","type":"heading","en":"Relative to the parent","level":2},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Width and height utilities are generated from the utility API in <code>_utilities.scss</code>. Includes support for <code>25%</code>, <code>50%</code>, <code>75%</code>, <code>100%</code>, and <code>auto</code> by default. Modify those values as you need to generate different utilities here."},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3142abc73a6b2263be23","height":300},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"w-25 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 25%</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 50%</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 75%</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 100%</div>\n<div class=\"w-auto p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width auto</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-2","type":"demo","key":"f173d5ecc7635b2e7f9e","height":147},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"h-25 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 25%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-50 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 50%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-75 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 75%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-100 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 100%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-auto d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height auto</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also use <code>max-width: 100%;</code> and <code>max-height: 100%;</code> utilities as needed."},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-3","type":"demo","key":"ec495fdffcef0aa330aa","height":147},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-3","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"mw-100\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-4","type":"demo","key":"fcbe311dd7ff5bcded9d","height":147},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-4","type":"code","value":"<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,.1);\">\n  <div class=\"mh-100\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 200px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1);\">Max-height 100%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-viewport","type":"heading","en":"Relative to the viewport","level":2},{"id":"relative-to-the-viewport--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also use utilities to set the width and height relative to the viewport."},{"id":"relative-to-the-viewport--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"min-vw-100\">Min-width 100vw</div>\n<div class=\"min-vh-100\">Min-height 100vh</div>\n<div class=\"vw-100\">Width 100vw</div>\n<div class=\"vh-100\">Height 100vh</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"sass","type":"heading","en":"Sass","level":2},{"id":"utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Utilities API","level":3},{"id":"utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Sizing utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/utilities/api/#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"    \"width\": (\n      property: width,\n      class: w,\n      values: (\n        25: 25%,\n        50: 50%,\n        75: 75%,\n        100: 100%,\n        auto: auto\n      )\n    ),\n    \"max-width\": (\n      property: max-width,\n      class: mw,\n      values: (100: 100%)\n    ),\n    \"viewport-width\": (\n      property: width,\n      class: vw,\n      values: (100: 100vw)\n    ),\n    \"min-viewport-width\": (\n      property: min-width,\n      class: min-vw,\n      values: (100: 100vw)\n    ),\n    \"height\": (\n      property: height,\n      class: h,\n      values: (\n        25: 25%,\n        50: 50%,\n        75: 75%,\n        100: 100%,\n        auto: auto\n      )\n    ),\n    \"max-height\": (\n      property: max-height,\n      class: mh,\n      values: (100: 100%)\n    ),\n    \"viewport-height\": (\n      property: height,\n      class: vh,\n      values: (100: 100vh)\n    ),\n    \"min-viewport-height\": (\n      property: min-height,\n      class: min-vh,\n      values: (100: 100vh)\n    ),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"3142abc73a6b2263be23","html":"\n<div class=\"w-25 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 25%</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 50%</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 75%</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 100%</div>\n<div class=\"w-auto p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width auto</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"f173d5ecc7635b2e7f9e","html":"\n<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"h-25 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 25%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-50 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 50%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-75 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 75%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-100 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 100%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-auto d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height auto</div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"ec495fdffcef0aa330aa","html":"\n<svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img mw-100\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: Max-width 100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">Max-width 100%</text></svg>\n\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fcbe311dd7ff5bcded9d","html":"\n<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,.1);\">\n  <div class=\"mh-100\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 200px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1);\">Max-height 100%</div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/parcel/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/rfs/"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/rtl/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/customize/overview/"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https